<Base title="Original sources and educator collections" description="Explore public Yusufa Sey videos and Fund Launch guides behind this independent acquisition education resource." type="Sources">
 <Crumbs items={[{title:'Sources'}]}/><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Go to the original</p><h1>Meet the material behind the guide.</h1><p>Two source collections inform the independent teaching here. Follow the links for each creator’s full context.</p></header><section class="split section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Collection 01 · Practitioner education</p><h2><a href="/sources/yusufa-sey/">{siteConfig.collections['yusufa-sey'].name}</a></h2><p class="spaced">Business acquisition education spanning deal sourcing, negotiation, borrowing, investors, and life after closing.</p></div><div><div class="stats-line"><span><strong>117</strong> videos and Shorts</span><span><strong>57</strong> captioned sources</span><span><strong>60</strong> audio recoveries</span></div><p class="spaced">Some short or incomplete recordings add little usable educational evidence. They remain in the source index so coverage is transparent.</p><a class="button secondary spaced" href="/sources/yusufa-sey/">Browse the collection</a></div></section><section class="split section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Collection 02 · Fund education</p><h2><a href="/sources/fund-launch/">{siteConfig.collections['fund-launch'].name}</a></h2><p class="spaced">The capital-provider view of independent sponsorship, private-credit funds, direct lending and mezzanine debt.</p></div><div><p>Four public guides inform selected financing explanations and an optional advanced learning path. Their terms are source-reported and may change.</p><a class="button secondary spaced" href="/sources/fund-launch/">Browse the guides</a></div></section><section class="section narrow"><h2>Read across both sides</h2><p class="spaced">Yusufa Sey’s videos primarily follow the buyer’s financing decisions. Fund Launch adds how a fund manager obtains capital, selects loans and answers to LPs. The collections do not verify each other’s prospective transactions.</p><a href="/methodology/" class="spaced">Read the methodology →</a></section>
</Base>
